no game data: cannot read SYS:bt/data/burntime.pack (Open failed (dos error 205))
This program carries none of Burntime's data.
Make burntime.pack from your own copy of Burntime with the packer (see ReadMe) and put it in SYS:bt/data/
or say where it is: MakeDir ENV:Burntime ENVARC:Burntime, then SetEnv SAVE Burntime/Data <drawer>, or `data <drawer>` when starting it.
